{"c":"EX-HN 3","m":"EX","p":"Yintang","n":"Hall of Impression (Third Eye)","t":["Extra Point","Calming point"],"loc":"On the midline of the forehead, exactly between the inner ends of the eyebrows.","find":"Rest a fingertip in the smooth spot just above the bridge of the nose.","uses":"Frontal headache, sinus congestion, eye strain, restlessness, insomnia, racing mind.","emo":"One of the most calming points on the body; quiets anxiety and mental chatter almost instantly.","spirit":"The third-eye gate; stills the mind into meditative quiet, restoring inner stillness and insight."},
{"c":"EX-HN 4","m":"EX","p":"Yuyao","n":"Fish Waist","t":["Extra Point"],"loc":"In the middle of the eyebrow, directly above the pupil when looking straight ahead.","uses":"Eye disorders, drooping or twitching eyelid, frontal headache, brow-bone pain."},
{"c":"EX-HN 5","m":"EX","p":"Taiyang","n":"Greater Yang (Temple)","t":["Extra Point"],"loc":"In the soft hollow of the temple, about 1 cun back from the midpoint between the outer eyebrow and the outer corner of the eye.","find":"Find the dip that flexes when you clench your jaw, on the side of the head.","uses":"The go-to point for headache: tension headache, migraine, eye strain, tired eyes, dizziness.","emo":"Releases the gripping tension of stress and concentration; calms an overworked head."},
{"c":"EX-HN 18","m":"EX","p":"Jiachengjiang","n":"Cheek Sauce Receptacle","t":["Extra Point"],"loc":"On the chin, 1 cun out to each side of CV 24 (the centre of the chin groove).","uses":"Facial paralysis, toothache, gum swelling, twitching of the chin."},
{"c":"EX (Anmian)","m":"EX","p":"Anmian","n":"Peaceful Sleep","t":["Extra Point","Insomnia point"],"loc":"Behind the ear, midway between the bony bump (mastoid, GB 12) and the hollow at the base of the skull (GB 20).","find":"Press the soft spot behind the ear, halfway toward the centre-back of the skull.","uses":"The dedicated sleep point: insomnia, trouble falling or staying asleep, restless nights, dizziness, palpitations.","emo":"Calms an overactive, anxious mind at bedtime; settles the racing thoughts that keep a person awake.","spirit":"Literally 'peaceful sleep'; lowers the spirit gently into deep, restorative rest."},
{"c":"EX-UE 9","m":"EX","p":"Baxie","n":"Eight Evils","t":["Extra Point","Set of 8"],"loc":"On the back of each hand, in the webbing between the fingers (four per hand), at the margins.","uses":"Swollen, painful or stiff fingers, numbness, arthritis of the hand, snake or insect bites."},
{"c":"EX-UE 11","m":"EX","p":"Shixuan","n":"Ten Diffusions","t":["Extra Point","Set of 10"],"loc":"At the very tip of each of the ten fingers, in the centre.","uses":"First-aid: loss of consciousness, heat-stroke, high fever, convulsions, finger numbness."},
{"c":"EX-LE 10","m":"EX","p":"Bafeng","n":"Eight Winds","t":["Extra Point","Set of 8"],"loc":"On the top of each foot, in the webbing between the toes (four per foot), at the margins.","uses":"Swollen, painful toes, foot numbness, fluid retention in the feet, snake bite."},
{"c":"EX-B 2","m":"EX","p":"Huatuojiaji","n":"Hua Tuo's Paravertebral Points","t":["Extra Point","Set along spine"],"loc":"A pair beside every vertebra from T1 to L5, 0.5 cun out from the lower border of each spinous process.","uses":"Regional spinal and organ complaints all along the back; back pain, and conditions of the organ at each level."}
